(F) longest-AP monotonicity: shorter longest-AP => higher D3 (spot-check)
======================================================================

  k=12:  min float-D3 grouped by longest-AP length L (large-diam shapes)
    longest-AP L= 2: min D3 = 0.70618
    longest-AP L= 3: min D3 = 0.60046
